#: ../../operations.rst:13 b421d4f656694d2883e11560bd85cb2c
msgid ""
"**Airtable**: ``AIRTABLE_TOKEN``, ``AIRTABLE_BASE_ID`` -- production, or "
"the dev base copied from it (see :doc:`development`)."
