msgstr ""

#: ../../operations.rst:20 08b2b7c5a31046a2b387ab3fddc7bbcb
msgid ""
"**Catalog / AI**: ``OCR_URL`` (label OCR sidecar, default "
"``http://ocr:8000``), ``ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`` and/or ``OPENROUTER_API_KEY``"
